<title>USA: WellCare Management CFO Corsones resigns.</title>
<headline>WellCare Management CFO Corsones resigns.</headline>
<dateline>KINGSTON, N.Y. 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>WellCare Management Group Inc said on Monday that its chief financial officer, Marystephanie Corsones, resigned and will be replaced by Howard Lorch.</p>
<p>Corsones will continue to advise and assist the company on strategic planning.</p>
<p>The company also said it named Mary Lee Campbell-Wisely as executive director of WellCare of New York Inc, its subsidiary, with responsibility for day-to-day management of the health-maintenance organization.</p>
